@step Record an invoice you sent to a customer.
aeat --format json app ledger invoice add --kind issued --counterparty-nif B12345674 --country-code ES --counterparty-name "Cliente SL" --invoice-number FAC-2026-001 --invoice-date 2026-02-15 --taxable-base 1000 --iva-rate 21
@capture invoice_id result.invoice_id
@step Confirm it resolved to a collectible invoice.
@result aeat --format json app ledger invoice view {invoice_id}
@expect result.invoice_id == "{invoice_id}"
@expect result.kind == "issued"
@expect result.grand_total == "1210.00"
